@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> CreateOrManageTasks : User starts creating/managing tasks
CreateOrManageTasks --> ViewAISuggestions : User accesses web interface
CreateOrManageTasks --> ManageTasks : User continues managing tasks
ManageTasks --> [*] : User completes task management
ViewAISuggestions --> ManageTasks : User applies suggestions
ManageTasks --> [*] : User exits
@enduml
